---
title: The Lighthouse · Kenneth Granberry
description: A light by which navigators avoid the rocks. Reflections before dawn on formation, the examined life, and the defense of what makes us human.
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block styles %}
<style>
  :root{ --measure:60ch; }

  /* hero — the night and the lamp */
  .hero{background:var(--night);color:var(--paper);padding:172px 0 96px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;}
  .lamp{position:absolute;left:50%;top:-8%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:520px;height:520px;pointer-events:none;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at center,rgba(230,192,121,.20),rgba(210,168,92,.07) 38%,rgba(210,168,92,0) 66%);}
  .beam{position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;width:280px;height:130%;transform:translateX(-50%);pointer-events:none;opacity:.5;
    background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(230,192,121,.10),rgba(230,192,121,0) 70%);
    clip-path:polygon(46% 0,54% 0,72% 100%,28% 100%);}
  .hero .inner{position:relative;}
  .hero .eyebrow{color:var(--star);display:block;margin-bottom:24px;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,5.6rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--paper);}
  .hero .tagline{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.3rem,3vw,1.85rem);color:var(--star-bright);margin:26px auto 0;max-width:30ch;line-height:1.3;}

  /* parable */
  .parable{padding:96px 0 40px;}
  .parable .kick{color:var(--star);display:block;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .parable h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.6vw,2.6rem);text-align:center;color:var(--ink);max-width:18ch;margin:0 auto 44px;line-height:1.12;}
  .passage{max-width:var(--measure);margin:0 auto;}
  .passage p{margin:0 0 22px;color:#2F313A;font-size:1.15rem;}
  .passage p:first-child{font-size:1.22rem;color:var(--ink);}
  .passage .scripture{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,1.65rem);line-height:1.32;color:#B07E1F;text-align:center;max-width:32ch;margin:40px auto 0;}

  /* subscribe */
  .subscribe{background:var(--night);color:var(--paper);margin:80px 0 0;padding:88px 0 92px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;}
  .subscribe::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:-30%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:120%;height:74%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(210,168,92,.12),rgba(210,168,92,0) 62%);pointer-events:none;}
  .subscribe .inner{position:relative;max-width:var(--measure);margin:0 auto;}
  .subscribe .eyebrow{color:var(--star);display:block;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .subscribe h3{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.2vw,2.3rem);color:var(--paper);max-width:24ch;margin:0 auto 18px;line-height:1.14;}
  .subscribe p{color:#D2CDC1;max-width:48ch;margin:0 auto 30px;}
  .capture{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;max-width:42ch;margin:0 auto;}
  .capture input{flex:1;min-width:220px;background:rgba(242,236,222,.06);border:1px solid var(--rule-dark);border-radius:3px;padding:15px 16px;color:var(--paper);font-family:"EB Garamond",serif;font-size:1rem;}
  .capture input::placeholder{color:var(--mist-dim);}
  .capture input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--star);}
  .capture button{font-family:"EB Garamond",serif;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--star);color:var(--night);border:none;border-radius:3px;padding:15px 28px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .25s ease;}
  .capture button:hover{background:var(--star-bright);}
  .capture .fineprint{flex-basis:100%;color:var(--mist-dim);font-size:.82rem;margin-top:10px;}
  .thanks{display:none;color:var(--star-bright);font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.4rem;margin-top:10px;}
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="hero">
  <span class="beam"></span>
  <span class="lamp"></span>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Reflections before dawn</span>
    <h1>The Lighthouse</h1>
    <p class="tagline">A light to steer by.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="parable">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow kick">Why the name</span>
    <h2>A light you can steer by.</h2>

    <div class="passage">
      <p>A navigator needs one thing he did not make and cannot move — a fixed light, set against the dark, that he can steer by. The sea takes his speed and bends his course; it cannot move the light. It does not sail the ship for him, and it does not calm the water. It holds, and it shines, and it lets the one who is willing to look find his bearing — and his way home.</p>
      <p>Someone keeps that light. He rises before the others, while it is still dark, and tends the lamp so that it is burning before it is needed.</p>
      <p>This is a record of that watch — a light kept through the night, for anyone still finding their way by it.</p>
      <p class="scripture">The light shines in the darkness, and the darkness has not overcome it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="subscribe">
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Keep the watch</span>
    <h3>A reflection before dawn, from the keeper of the light.</h3>
    <p>Short writings on formation, the examined life, and the defense of what makes us human — sent while it is still dark, to carry into the day. Enter your email and I will send you the first.</p>
    <form class="capture" id="captureForm" data-capture="swap" data-capture-thanks="#thanks">
      <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="your@email.com" aria-label="Email address" required>
      <button type="submit">Light the lamp</button>
      <span class="fineprint">One reflection at a time. No noise. Unsubscribe whenever you wish.</span>
    </form>
    <p class="thanks" id="thanks">The lamp is lit. The first reflection is on its way — watch for it before dawn.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
